---
/**
 * The "PipelineZ" wordmark, set as real text (Geist, bold)
 * rather than a vector logo file — the mark is just the product name with
 * an accent-colored "Z", so plain text gets that color for free from the
 * theme's own --sl-color-accent token, with no separate SVG asset to keep
 * in sync when the accent changes (see theme-lab). Callers set size/color
 * on their own wrapping element; this component only owns the "Z"'s accent
 * color.
 */
---

<span class="pz-wordmark" translate="no">Pipeline<span class="pz-wordmark-z">Z</span></span>

<style>
	.pz-wordmark {
		font-family: 'Geist Variable', var(--sl-font-system);
		font-weight: 800;
	}
	.pz-wordmark-z {
		color: var(--sl-color-accent);
	}
</style>
